#: scenario6:scenario6_409F3110_1A13_408B_BE13_46672FF5AEFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8fdd4155f1a3d705d34955fb4cc314b6f6305f3039469d43e0146b7b74d5cd03
#. default-sha256: d73fd4e3d5d6fbb7d581b0413e3fe5dd4caa533a27bbe01f170117dde78dc77b
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_409F3110_1A13_408B_BE13_46672FF5AEFE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Time pressed "
"onward,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫그리고 ⟪k:15⟫시간"
"이 지나……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_E00C943F_4D75_42F5_B79C_13668E56E37E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8295de9cee74a679893f2d1d287101331c33c9feb7195a04b7ca4f86544a5f29
#. default-sha256: 251e0176344eb912cdf40e7dcc83b0feeca4f339ab5feb06967a59167b8670da
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_E00C943F_4D75_42F5_B79C_13668E56E37E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and then, at long last, you arrived."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫마침내 ⟪k:1⟫당신이 나타났어요――"

#: scenario6:scenario6_DD418C23_5115_4DCC_BC33_8D2938BF2673
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aedc10305dab388a366738aa9cd2df5c00e0d8c9a4e29c65cea6ee78d442b0ec
#. default-sha256: 852cfb9c12c1d277d97b168161444872ec65254c91a528460de3f784e1575605
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_DD418C23_5115_4DCC_BC33_8D2938BF2673"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Oh, splendid...⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫You have finally awoken."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫어머……, ⟪k:9⟫드디어 일어나셨군요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_D6CCF4FC_DAA4_44F3_A35A_928A6859D487
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a96be30caecdda759aa8c52e78a103b0cd7212db41fd228e5182fd5149b59eb
#. default-sha256: 957b10fedafc09b15f19bc448d6a3f672e83093001c41c1368294f1f67d4a638
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D6CCF4FC_DAA4_44F3_A35A_928A6859D487"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I have simply been waiting so long for this moment."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저는 ⟪k:1⟫이 순간을 손꼽아 기다렸거든요……."

#: scenario6:scenario6_EFCBAFD9_6E52_4944_8753_711F7D9B6242
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fac199ac2a3bde627a4db1575b8332d6562306998d59fa6bc15d38799e74e10c
#. default-sha256: 648d955f6179caa01069c0eade5b749e8b5b3271f088723db81eb9dfad8c6d25
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_EFCBAFD9_6E52_4944_8753_711F7D9B6242"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tending to the mansion all by my lonesome,⟪k:1⟫ensuring it was ready for your return, Master—"
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫whenever that time may be."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫이 저택을 홀로 관리하며, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫주인님께서 언제든 귀환하셔도 되게끔 준비를 하였답니다."

#: scenario6:scenario6_0C8D0830_48A8_4A58_A8AC_3AE5EA6582BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f25cc27c6380e176a47d093b98f954bd6dcb96fe8c6dc022a3d1ba616094e6c
#. default-sha256: e6f431de1262486ba62ce1b80e2c574d7abc7325d3154bb8f1a1228151c1dd13
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_0C8D0830_48A8_4A58_A8AC_3AE5EA6582BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When I caught sight of you through the window,⟪k:1⟫my heart fluttered. ⟪k:2⟫The time had "
"finally arrived."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫창가에서 주인님께서 오시는 걸 보았을 때, ⟪k:1⟫저는 ⟪k:2⟫마침내 이 순간이 왔구나 싶었지요……."

#: scenario6:scenario6_67B74B9F_702E_4DDA_9756_FBF35BA48BFA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78a0c2fbcaa9424dee9773a1a97df219c99a176a0e587f868e638d4e6ad2ab89
#. default-sha256: c86c777cc12ae8453697f218743bcfbc582fc3c818aa8d020a7afe342048dd0b
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_67B74B9F_702E_4DDA_9756_FBF35BA48BFA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh my, you do not know who I am?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Do you not know who you are, either?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫어머, ⟪k:2⟫제가 누구냐고요?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그러면 본인이 누군지도……, ⟪k:5⟫말인지요?"

#: scenario6:scenario6_2D316048_7959_4D35_9CC6_A42713AAF5F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 985bdeaa0fd16f01f0edd1573796f875a66345337fb0f1480879136baf23a79b
#. default-sha256: a4a1f7806a42284790434d45c56f0ec7cad8928c685f49911a9553934622282a
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_2D316048_7959_4D35_9CC6_A42713AAF5F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That is quite the predicament."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그거 큰일이군요……. 곤란한걸요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_39AFFC0F_BAC7_44C7_9951_ACB95A3C6BFA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 52558bb91f73681772af8362476615db2ccee23c7eade69c3d17448cf343371d
#. default-sha256: ee87fd24a75fe30d0438635ff58ce2ad0b126ab2cd7e36b26fedd9716be27def
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_39AFFC0F_BAC7_44C7_9951_ACB95A3C6BFA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Then how about this?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그렇다면 ⟪k:2⟫이렇게 하지요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_F56C1453_143C_4056_A206_C584B42B7282
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: beeb16ccfd650e61cc5d6ac039e055cab1c2cc22c937224041357cf0c21c8c04
#. default-sha256: a00508aa336e3357716054b6fd99724e28ffd729ac00b14b062841001762e96c
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F56C1453_143C_4056_A206_C584B42B7282"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I am a servant of this mansion, and as such, I am familiar with the many incidents that have "
"taken place here.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I shall show you the history of this house, Master."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저는 이 저택의 시녀, ⟪k:1⟫여기서 일어난 여러 사건을 압니다. ⟪k:2⟫주인님께 저택의 역사를 보여 "
"드리겠습니다."

#: scenario6:scenario6_82B04417_9973_4CFA_B57C_199EC1D32C00
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e2168cf19513e422e75aaa08eb93339fbd17533ced3ce89a08a177389288448
#. default-sha256: 54a9258738891241297a532f57d06e8f210f54899001802dbe79d7abca298847
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_82B04417_9973_4CFA_B57C_199EC1D32C00"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Let us be off, then.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And fear not—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I merely entreat you not to let go "
"of my hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그러면 가 보지요. ⟪k:2⟫괜찮답니다. ⟪k:3⟫안심하시길.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫부디 제 손을 놓지 말아 주시"
"어요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_4863F686_6A3A_40FA_8698_038389769158
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af37b781585024a8cf5df48fe9440b6a3f33dc09def9d3b40f89c59b073ba049
#. default-sha256: d774339f0b7be34cb8b427405ad4764818461cf683a0d8e730e66217d4e14d1b
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_4863F686_6A3A_40FA_8698_038389769158"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Should you hold it tightly, you need not worry about being washed away by the waves of "
"history."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫손을 잡고 계시면 ⟪k:1⟫역사의 파도에 휩쓸릴 걱정은 없답니다."

#: scenario6:scenario6_24F59810_6B2E_4DD4_AB93_1073D746BA04
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0e8874d44c64b66912b4c3d576bd10fcfba4cc2333f25a9064198e307274c11
#. default-sha256: f4e2529943660171068c2494b9ce8c37916c102e01ae04a99ea1def23fbd3705
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_24F59810_6B2E_4DD4_AB93_1073D746BA04"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No matter what happens, you mustn’t let go of my hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫예……, 어떤 일이 있어도, ⟪k:1⟫제 손을 ⟪k:2⟫놓지 말아 주시어요……."

#: scenario6:scenario6_163EC0D0_E2FF_4174_9059_D4A83D451B52
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61d34f7ab1e84e4327ae18386d46bad46dec05505444dca2dcd55922924624ff
#. default-sha256: 106fcc4a98fc27c86b664e1768eb0bebfa74632922aaca61273c93dbc7bdddd8
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_163EC0D0_E2FF_4174_9059_D4A83D451B52"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫No matter what happens..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫어떤 일이 있어도……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_4DF94911_E146_44DB_9E37_A31671194188
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90f2160c5f9993d796983d587ca5ffbc43d2a2df6875ef2fe69bf665b0ed68ea
#. default-sha256: ad7f83983ea84dc67986221061ac4a62986090439f93704449350346fdea5d1f
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_4DF94911_E146_44DB_9E37_A31671194188"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫no matter what you see..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫무슨 일이 일어나도……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_BF129CA0_712B_4687_BB76_D5CAAE6E3137
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 910839622902deb7f48a0080e966e27a51d401bddb809d1d9692fba565841df8
#. default-sha256: a8f4fa02eb0bfdb8b91e944d5ca80c759d125613476e48ca28eef27aaf325a8b
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_BF129CA0_712B_4687_BB76_D5CAAE6E3137"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫never again..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫다시는――"

#: scenario6:scenario6_9CB7481D_46BE_4B1A_ACA9_2845B727CBC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd40e8cdd729eddee184e4381cf89e125f79e648b1816fe92f0018dc7b53c484
#. default-sha256: 04d895917b65fa1ac3a1d9658d67da84806420a4ccdbd6cfb52353644e0aefce
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_9CB7481D_46BE_4B1A_ACA9_2845B727CBC5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫let go of this hand..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫이 손을 놓지 말아 주세요……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_18E2B9AF_AE3C_41CE_A368_93578918249C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02f35de970e2721a6a17a2772412d97465361eae4638f823964bec880cb2e907
#. default-sha256: 9304993ff70f36f45c1c805ec3a2979289e670affd7c6c4aed3b56e6111976a7
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_18E2B9AF_AE3C_41CE_A368_93578918249C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That... ⟪k:5⟫is everything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……이게…… ⟪k:5⟫끝이에요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_99153502_C32A_4E03_9DD6_822B712B48DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 371c5102a60250cfa7d1f3d2433b40549edecb3e482cf2aba7cd3028d37bd22f
#. default-sha256: 90538024ccc26d33f755bd8e0344d07f22708f0a18b0217d367197fb77678e44
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_99153502_C32A_4E03_9DD6_822B712B48DF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫…………."

#: scenario6:scenario6_1266F294_ED32_406E_94D6_8CCA1AF6B90C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89abb7002f97a7a7723030425f283b6d286e9b80d88be34cfc6718055e8511b7
#. default-sha256: 1ee4110c983c8b43228836ca4c06c44cafb48f36163cd12ca09c5843f8ee5a4f
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_1266F294_ED32_406E_94D6_8CCA1AF6B90C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I prepared a number of things to say when she was finished with her tale,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫모든 이야기를 마친 지젤에게⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫할 말을 여럿 생각해 두었지만――"

#: scenario6:scenario6_0CF713FA_806D_4B6A_BAA0_BF374F4C56E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 621b1dcbf4784585ffaa469a847f750c681f2286a6635e564d487523ec1ddf6e
#. default-sha256: ef294536ae9996939b69c3e9ced5f915491d6e5a792d2525704e0202ec392d89
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_0CF713FA_806D_4B6A_BAA0_BF374F4C56E0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but I can’t manage to put any of them into words."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 모든 말을 ⟪k:1⟫꺼낼 수 없었다."

#: scenario6:scenario6_1F1C88CC_6A6E_4ECC_868A_58408AC2ABA6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a86dfb8bae1f5ad36a6deb9bdfd6c8182eda4b4d16398daac38383593d71013
#. default-sha256: c2d287cc92f108774c228cff109e2cae9c5315c04a5e1a60b167b0e33643e1d6
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_1F1C88CC_6A6E_4ECC_868A_58408AC2ABA6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I almost hate myself for thinking it would be so easy."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫지젤에게 자기 자신을 되찾게 한 후……, ⟪k:1⟫그 진실을 내가 받아들여서……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_E53F052F_E604_466B_A462_5229FDF0E856
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 787a0ee148a78499199bbf17a22b829ff858572859834b4ff59d7061f96f4694
#. default-sha256: 02256d043d177ec8061e6266e7f1d71f45d996170c008bfc78553137a83d2d9b
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_E53F052F_E604_466B_A462_5229FDF0E856"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For letting myself hope I could simply pull her back to her old self,⟪k:1⟫accept whatever "
"had happened to her,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫다시금 지젤의 손을 잡으면――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫모든 게 ⟪k:3⟫해결되어 ⟪k:4⟫끝나진 않을지――"

#: scenario6:scenario6_F3D5627E_7C28_445A_9C3F_932FF496F53E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 901c003f94fce9ac2dc8f9f46ea06399e587ba7cffde21a2de2a41bea94048cf
#. default-sha256: 9d8f3b6f3429b689179b9bb0bfee8c88f36487c02de912e37fa055bab115142f
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F3D5627E_7C28_445A_9C3F_932FF496F53E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫take her hand in mine, and that would solve everything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그런 기대를 하던 내가 ⟪k:1⟫한심하기 짝이 없다……."

#: scenario6:scenario6_218D7FBB_C459_4977_BB6A_96B43570A67F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 212a598f8949545933e7d6424a96c382bad56ad6505e0b64b89e861813ba49b6
#. default-sha256: 28115d3c3db32eb55467aacbb4f2955fa8f5a459b342b711cc70ae528f38a8e9
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_218D7FBB_C459_4977_BB6A_96B43570A67F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The truth is so much worse than I imagined—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫so much more harrowing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫지젤의 진실은 ⟪k:1⟫내 상상보다 훨씬 잔혹했으며――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫절망적이었다."

#: scenario6:scenario6_16D0120E_43DD_41D0_A19C_830C0C139E1D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22f68d29ca6f468211dc6e39f0be88f166e335f034cefa3efc279f8c74833778
#. default-sha256: 82abf3bd8f18de00a1fa6c298d76262142f2faebb470df80fbe45fd0f7ecdd77
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_16D0120E_43DD_41D0_A19C_830C0C139E1D"
